---
import { Waves } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section class="w-full bg-[#F4EFE6] py-20 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-dorado-arena text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold mb-5">
      <Waves class="w-4 h-4 text-dorado-arena stroke-[1.5]" />
      <span data-i18n="quotePill">Hospitalidad Cántabra</span>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="font-serif italic text-2xl sm:text-4xl text-marino-vibrante leading-snug font-normal tracking-tight max-w-2xl mx-auto" data-i18n="quoteText">
      “Una casa cuidada frente al mar para saborear el norte sin prisas.”
    </blockquote>

    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="h-0.5 w-12 bg-dorado-arena/40 rounded-full mb-3"></div>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-[#2A4737] font-semibold" data-i18n="quoteAuthor">
        — Ivan, tu anfitrión en Suances
      </p>
      <span class="text-[11px] text-stone-600 font-normal mt-0.5">Apartamento Costa del Sol · Suances (Cantabria)</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
